From d887153b66d01ac8a1efd707212dd7bf211dd7c0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: OreoYang <oreo.yang@vecima.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 09:54:33 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] validation FEATURE use the incremental validator when the diff is complete

sr_apply_changes() and the copy-config/replace-config path reach
sr_changes_notify_store() with a notify_diff that describes every change made
to the stored data, which is the precondition of libyang's incremental
validator. Validate changed modules with lyd_validate_module_incr() instead of
in full; whenever libyang cannot prove the edit safe, the module is validated
in full as before.

Incremental validation is a build option: cmake -DENABLE_VALIDATE_INCREMENTAL=ON
(default) or OFF (every edit validated in full). Each process logs once, at its
first sr_connect, which one it was built with. At sr_disconnect the call,
fallback and late-fallback counters are logged, as a warning only when there
were fallbacks. The shallow delete option is passed from modinfo, and the
assumption that the stored data was valid before the edit is documented.

Tests: end-to-end sr_apply_changes cases (cross-module leafref, must, when,
cascades, replaced default case), delete matrix, and add/modify/product-shape
differential cases that expect the same verdict as full validation.

Requires the libyang incremental validation patch. Squash of
Oreo/incremental-validation-3.7.11 (d887153b) on the product base
1b720b196f63 (Yocto sysrepo_3.7.11). Commits:
  e9851f81 validation FEATURE use the incremental validator when the diff is complete
  6c8c533e validation FEATURE log incremental enablement at warning level
  5f0a6171 tests FEATURE incremental validation end-to-end test
  4cd88709 validation FEATURE log late incremental validation fallbacks
  ef14d144 validation FEATURE incremental validation is a build option, on by default
  e9676d58 validation BUGFIX document the valid stored data assumption of incremental validation
  1c896bf9 validation FEATURE shallow delete scope, delete safety matrix
  a89d3a5c validation FEATURE add, modify and product-shape differential cases
  65acc42b validation FEATURE gap-shape tests for production rule coverage
  f9bacbf3 validation FEATURE mirror structural YANG constraint rows in incr differential tests
  2c054c01 validation: establish full validation baseline
  09ca0a2b test: cover incremental validation connection baselines
  011676cc test: cover per-module full validation baselines across modules
  d887153b test: simulate SIGKILL during apply_changes for crash recovery
